                    <characteristic name="Effect" typeId="fd7f-888d-3257-a12b">This unit has the **^^Juramentado a Slaanesh^^** keyword.
In addition, while this unit includes any standard bearers, if this unit charged this turn, add 1 to the Attacks characteristic of this unit&apos;s melee weapons for the rest of the turn.</characteristic>
                  </characteristics>
                </profile>
              </profiles>
